  "description": "Build and manage your own geeky supermarket in Weeb Store Simulator: Supermarket Together, a fun and chaotic store management simulator where games, manga, and collectibles rule the shelves!\n\nStart small with a humble shop and grow it into a bustling paradise for gamers and anime fans. Stock video games and consoles, organize manga and comics, display figurines and toys, and keep customers happy by quickly handling restocks and checkout rush hours.\n\nUnlock new licenses, expand your store layout, take on special tasks, and optimize your workflow to boost profits. Play solo or team up with up to 4 players in online co-op, where teamwork, coordination, and a bit of chaos turn your shop into a thriving entertainment megastore.",
